# DIAGNOSTIC ANALYSIS: plutus-ts Setup Generation Failure

## 1. Classification

**Task type:** Plan-first diagnostic (multi-root-cause debugging).
**Scope:** Four concurrent failures — (a) post-filter collapse 10→3 on DXY/EUR, (b) 0 setups on GBP/USD, (c) 0 setups on AUD/USD, (d) LQZ detection dead in pipeline despite passing smoke tests.
**Severity:** Critical — pipeline output is 25% of target (6 vs 24) and GBP/AUD are completely silent.

