## 4. FIX STRATEGY (prioritized phases)

### Phase A — Restore the Python triple-loop in the ACTIVE generator (Highest priority)

**Target:** `TradeBrain.generateSetups()` (the non-deprecated path). If the legacy `constructBasicSetups` at `plutus-tte-pipeline.ts:2590` is still in the call graph, replace its body with the corrected loop below.

**Corrected code (replace the single-shape block cited in `V3.2_FIX_PLAN.md:34-50`):**

```typescript
private constructBasicSetups(
    pair: string,
    zoneMap: ZoneMapSnapshot,
    shapePrediction: ShapePredictionSnapshot,
    setupCounter: number,
    lszZones: LSZResult[] = [],
    optionStrikes: OptionStrikeData[] = [],
    currentPrice: number = 0,
    weeklyRangePips: number = 0,
): TradeSetup[] {
    const setups: TradeSetup[] = [];
    const spot = zoneMap.spots[pair] ?? currentPrice;
    const pipValue = PIP_VALUE[pair] ?? PIP_VALUE_DEFAULT;
    const shapeChain = shapePrediction.shapeChain;
    const dayDecomposition = shapeChain.dayDecomposition ?? [];
    const zones = [...zoneMap.zones];
    const isDXY = pair === 'DXY';
    const isAUD = pair === 'AUD/USD';

    // Pair-allowed categories (RC2 fix)
    const allowedCategories: Set<SetupCategory> = isAUD
        ? new Set([SetupCategory.HTF_SWING, SetupCategory.BREAKOUT_SURGE])
        : new Set([
            SetupCategory.SWING_SCALP,
            SetupCategory.HTF_SWING,
            SetupCategory.BREAKOUT_SURGE,
            SetupCategory.REINFORCEMENT,
            SetupCategory.TRANSITION,
          ]);

    // RC1 fix: iterate the FULL day decomposition, not just currentShape
    const dayShapes = dayDecomposition.length > 0
        ? dayDecomposition
        : [{ day: this.resolveDaySession(pair).day,
             shape: shapeChain.currentShape,
             session: this.resolveDaySession(pair).session }];

    for (const dayEntry of dayShapes) {                         // OUTER: days
        const day = dayEntry.day;
        const shape = dayEntry.shape;
        const session = dayEntry.session;
        const shapeCategories = SHAPE_CATEGORIES_MAP[shape] ?? [];

        // RC2 fix: intersect shape categories with pair-allowed categories
        const viableCategories = shapeCategories.filter(c => allowedCategories.has(c));
        if (viableCategories.length === 0) continue;            // skip dead shape for this pair

        for (const zone of zones) {                             // MIDDLE: zones
            for (const category of viableCategories) {          // INNER: categories
                const setup = this.buildSingleSetup(
                    pair, zone, category, shape, day, session,
                    spot, pipValue, setupCounter + setups.length,
                    optionStrikes, weeklyRangePips,
                );
                if (setup && setup.quality !== SetupQuality.REJECTED) {
                    setups.push(setup);
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // RC4 fix: dedup AFTER all days accumulate, not per-day
    return this.dedupByDirectionEntry(setups, pair);
}
```

**Blast radius:** Medium. Changes setup count per pair from 0–10 to potentially 20–40 (before cap). Downstream consumers (firewall, report, dedup) must handle higher input volume. Dedup must move outside the day loop (already shown).

