### Phase E — Relax dedup to preserve cross-day setups (RC4)

**Target:** dedup function (likely in setup post-processing).

**Current (inferred from `SYNTHESIS/03` Phase 6):** dedup by `(direction, entry@2dp)`.

**Problem:** With the Phase A triple-loop fix, the SAME zone can produce valid setups on multiple days with different categories. Dedup by entry alone destroys these legitimate variants.

**Corrected dedup key:**

```typescript
function dedupKey(s: TradeSetup): string {
    // Include category + day so a Mon HTF_SWING and Tue BREAKOUT_SURGE
    // at the same entry are treated as distinct setups
    return `${s.pair}|${s.direction}|${s.category}|${s.day}|${s.entry.toFixed(2)}`;
}

function dedupByDirectionEntry(setups: TradeSetup[], pair: string): TradeSetup[] {
    const seen = new Map<string, TradeSetup>();
    for (const s of setups) {
        const k = dedupKey(s);
        if (!seen.has(k) || seen.get(k)!.confidence_score < s.confidence_score) {
            seen.set(k, s);
        }
    }
    // Apply MAX_SETUPS_PER_PAIR cap AFTER dedup, sorted by confidence
    return [...seen.values()]
        .sort((a, b) => b.confidence_score - a.confidence_score)
        .slice(0, MAX_SETUPS_PER_PAIR);                        // 10 per SYNTHESIS/02
}
```

**Blast radius:** Low. More setups survive dedup → more candidates for firewall/cap.

