| Phase E (dedup key) | Low | Setups with same entry different category may confuse report renderer | Verify report handles 1 entry × N rows |
| Phase F (target) | None | None | Documentation only |

**Cross-cutting risk:** Phases A + E together may push DXY/EUR from 3 → 10 setups each, exceeding the firewall's designed throughput. The firewall (`V3.2_BUILD_REPORT` §24: "ZT-17 and CS12 Mode Flags") may have implicit batch-size assumptions. Run a shadow comparison before enabling in production.

